AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001927> "A relation between a value specification and an entity which the specification is about."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_0001927> "specifies value of")
