AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000059> "denoted by family under triclinic symmetry"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000059> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000164>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000059> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000119>)

