SubObjectPropertyOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000164>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000060> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000120>)

