AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000061> "denoted by family under orthorhombic symmetry"@de)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000061> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000164>)
ObjectPropertyDomain(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000061> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000121>)

