SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000041> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000141>)
SubClassOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000041> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0000086> ObjectIntersectionOf(<https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000026> ObjectHasValue(<https://w3id.org/pmd/co/PMD_0000077> <https://w3id.org/pmd/cryo/CRYO_0000035>))))
